'''''An Invitation Without Proffer''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Sit tight &mdash; the Express will be starting up soon
# Talk to Himeko
# Participate in the Navigation Meeting
# Convince Dan Heng to vote for your destination
# Return to the Parlor Car and vote for your destination
# Head off with Welt and March 7th

