;(Talk to Himeko)
:'''Himeko:''' Morning, (Trailblazer). You're very punctual.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And a wonderful morning to you, Himeko.
::'''Himeko:''' *sigh* I can't remember the last time I got such a polite response.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Punctual is my middle name.
::'''Himeko:''' Well hang onto it, it's cute.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm reporting Dan Heng for&mdash;
::'''Himeko:''' Ah, no need to worry, Dan Heng's rarely late. I'm sure he must have a good reason...
::'''Himeko:''' Dan Heng's situation is special &mdash; we hope to protect him to the best of our ability.
:'''Himeko:''' The trailblazing of Jarilo-VI has drawn to a close, and the Astral Express must depart for the next planet.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's the next planet like?
::'''Himeko:''' Not telling yet... We'll make an official announcement in the meeting, but I'm keeping you in suspense for now~
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Trailblazing really is a full-time job, huh.
::'''Himeko:''' The universe is boundless, and trailblazing never ends... Even a lifetime isn't enough to explore every world. That's the beauty of the unknown.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Any chance for a little break first?
::'''Himeko:''' That hardly sounds like you, (Trailblazer). What about that Stellaron inside you? Don't you wanna get rid of it?
:'''Himeko:''' The meeting will start soon.

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:'''Welt:''' You're looking well, (Trailblazer).
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You coming with us this time?
::'''Welt:''' Haha, you better believe it. You guys really put on a show for Jarilo-VI &mdash; I'm eager to join in myself.
::'''Welt:''' I gotta say, there were more than a few times where I wanted to lend a hand... but Himeko said I should let you youngsters rise to the trailblazing challenges...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you know what our next destination is?
::'''Welt:''' I know alright, but I can't tell you yet. Himeko wants to create a sense of mystery for you and March.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What world do you want to go to?
::'''Welt:''' That I want to go to? ...My home world, I suppose. Sadly, its location doesn't appear on the Express' astral chart records, at least the ones that are undamaged.
::'''Welt:''' In any case, I do want to see some other civilizations before I go home. It'd be a crime to waste this opportunity on the Express.

;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' See, it's like I said: If you wake up and Dan Heng's not around, then you probably won't see him the rest of the day either.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Didn't Himeko say not to worry?
::'''March 7th:''' I guess. To be honest, warp navigation meetings are basically just like that "teambuilding" you're always going on about. You don't have to show up, but Himeko might be upset if you don't.
::'''March 7th:''' Think about it, Dan Heng's the one managing the archives &mdash; he'll already be clued in to our next destination. Himeko and Welt know already, of course... so it's just me and you in the dark!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Dan Heng sure is a mysterious guy.
::'''March 7th:''' Yeah... I heard he did something incredible once, and now some powerful force has his name on a wanted list. My guess is the Xianzhou Alliance or the Garden of Recollection. In any case, it can't be the IPC &mdash; I've seen their wanted list.
::'''March 7th:''' Hmm... I bet it is the Garden of Recollection. Didn't it seem like Dan Heng was super keen on talking to Herta? Everyone knows that Herta and the Garden of Recollection don't get along. They say the enemy of your enemy is your friend...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How shocking...
::'''March 7th:''' Ha! Shocking? I guess you're still new &mdash; you'll find out how strange everyone is around here sooner or later...
::'''March 7th:''' What's with the funny look? Am I not strange enough for you? Name me an amnesiac that didn't have some crazy backstory. I already made up a few dozen for myself.

;(Talk to Pom-Pom)
;(First interaction)
::'''Pom-Pom:''' Ahem... (Trailblazer), did you receive the destination overview? Excited?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Himeko's going to announce it in the meeting.
:::'''Pom-Pom:''' So you don't know yet...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We got it.
:::'''Pom-Pom:''' You don't seem very excited...
