:'''Himeko:''' I've seen your face before, Stellaron Hunter, even if it was only on a Corporation wanted poster. They were offering quite the bounty... dead or alive. Do you know the figure?
:'''Kafka:''' Doesn't concern me. Then again, a Corporation bounty is a compliment, not an insult, don't you think? The higher the figure, the bigger the compliment.
:'''March 7th:''' You wanted criminals sure know how to look on the bright side of things...
:'''Himeko:''' ...I will say, Herta certainly paid you all a compliment: "A {{Rubi|maniac|Elio}} that claims he can see destiny, leading a bunch of {{Rubi|wild lunatics|Stellaron Hunters}} in pursuit of the most dangerous objects in the universe!" ...And Herta doesn't give out compliments very often.
:'''Kafka:''' In pursuit of the most dangerous objects in the universe, huh? ...In that sense, you Astral Expressers and I are cut from the same cloth.
:'''Himeko:''' You're in the wrong place, Kafka. We're not about to accept your request, and we're not about to get into bed with a Stellaron Hunter. It was nice talking with you. Perhaps next time you'll be willing to pay us a visit in person and we can continue our little discussion.
:'''Kafka:''' Have you guys heard of the Luofu?
:'''Welt:''' ...The Xianzhou Luofu? It belongs to the Hexafleet of the Xianzhou Alliance. We've heard of it.
:'''Kafka:''' Mm. But what you haven't heard is that it's currently very close to you &mdash; a couple of warp jumps away, in fact.
:'''Kafka:''' Not to mention, 45 system hours ago... a Stellaron burst occurred on the Luofu.
:'''Kafka:''' An unexpected calamity... don't you think?
:'''Welt:''' What exactly are you Stellaron Hunters trying to do...? The Xianzhou Alliance aren't us &mdash; they won't give you time to explain. Once you draw the attention of {{Rubi|The Hunt|Lan}}, you become their prey. The Alliance will hunt you to the end of the universe...
:'''Himeko:''' Stop speaking in riddles, Kafka. Say what you have to say.
:'''Kafka:''' ...It's simple. That Stellaron has nothing to do with us, but the Xianzhou is convinced that we're responsible.
:'''Kafka:''' My companion Blade has been taken away by the Cloud Knights. I want to bring him back, resolve this Stellaron crisis, and clear our names.
:'''March 7th:''' Nothing to do with you? Yeah right &mdash; sounds like a weird coincidence to me. You just happened to show up after the Stellaron burst...?
:'''March 7th:''' Also, we're not your friends. Why should we care if a Stellaron Hunter is innocent, hmm~?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We should seal the Stellaron and help the Xianzhou.
