;(Talk to Himeko)
:'''Himeko:''' This time you'll get the chance to witness Welt in action, haha. I'm glad he's going with you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So Welt's got skills?
::'''Himeko:''' He doesn't talk much about his past. If you ask him, he'll just tell you about how he worked in animation...
::'''Himeko:''' ...But that's only a small part of his story. Believe me when I say he has more experience than I do.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I knew there was more to him than meets the eye...
::'''Himeko:''' You could say he keeps his cards close to his chest. If you ask him, he'll just tell you about how he worked in animation...
::'''Himeko:''' ...But that's only a small part of his story. Believe me when I say he has more experience than I do.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't worry, I'll take care of March and him.
::'''Himeko:''' Haha, much appreciated, (Trailblazer).

;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' Allll this universe, and we just happen to bump into a Xianzhou ship that Dan Heng spent time on? That's gotta be fate! I wonder what Dan Heng stories await us.
:'''March 7th:''' That guy sure has a mysterious past. We gotta take this opportunity on the Luofu to dig into it!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Darn straight.
::'''March 7th:''' I knew you'd be excited! Check out the master of gossip over here.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Give the man some privacy, please.
::'''March 7th:''' *sigh* Fine, you're right... In that case, we'll just have to take loads of selfies till he gets super jealous.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That might be dangerous...
::'''March 7th:''' Huh? Is his past really that dark?
::'''March 7th:''' *sigh* Fine, I'll leave him alone then. We'll just have to take loads of selfies till he gets super jealous.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (I wonder if she even remembers we've got a job to do down there...)

;(Talk to Pom-Pom)
:'''Pom-Pom:''' Have a safe trip you guys!

;(Talk to Dan Heng)
:'''Dan Heng:''' You need to take extra care on this expedition. I've compiled some intel on the Xianzhou for you, I hope it comes in useful.
:'''March 7th:''' Ugh, Look, it's just containers as far as the eye can see.
:'''March 7th:''' This area isn't for receiving guests, it's for unloading cargo! Who decided to send us this way?
:'''March 7th:''' Such a huge port and not a soul in sight. It gives me the creeps...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} At this point, I think it'd be creepier if we did see someone...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yet someone opened the gate for us...
:'''March 7th:''' Ah! Stop talking! If there is someone here, they're in my bad books already.
:'''March 7th:''' Mr. Yang, what should we do?
:'''Welt:''' We should start with the person who opened the Jade Gate. If it turns out they're not friendly, then at least they've already made things easier for us. If it turns out they were just doing their job, then we can ask them what happened here.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're pretty decisive...
::'''March 7th:''' That's Mr. Yang &mdash; this is child's play for him. He's dealt with all kinds of dangers before.
::What if they're not friendly and we can't defeat them...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What if they're not friendly and we can't defeat them...?
:'''March 7th:''' Are you forgetting we've got Mr. Yang with us? Oh, right, you haven't seen what he can do yet...
:'''Welt:''' Let's move. Keep your wits about you.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

